'''Christopher Weldon Davis''' (born July 26, 1963) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for the [[New York Giants]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL).<ref>{{Cite web |title=Chris Davis stats |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/D/DaviCh23.htm |access-date=2023-04-10 |publisher=Pro Football Reference}}</ref> He played [[college football]] for the [[Purdue Boilermakers football|Purdue Boilermakers]] and [[San Diego State Aztecs football|San Diego State Aztecs]].
